<title>USA: ServiceMaster buys auto outsourcing firm.</title>
<headline>ServiceMaster buys auto outsourcing firm.</headline>
<dateline>DOWNERS GROVE, Ill. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ServiceMaster LP said Tuesday it acquired Premier Manufacturing Support Services Inc, a company that oursources services to the automotive industry.</p>
<p>Premier specializes in paint booth maintenance as well as general custodial and other services to car manufacturers. It anticipates annualized revenues for 1996 of about $90 million.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
